  "title": "Evaluate the audit team’s judgments",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Evaluate the audit team’s judgments</h2><p>Review four statements from the engagement file and identify the best corrective action.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs2-f1\">Correct the treatment of contrary evidence</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs2-f1\"><option value=\"Investigate and resolve the inconsistency\">Investigate and resolve the inconsistency</option><option value=\"Rely on past honesty\">Rely on past honesty</option><option value=\"Ignore nonfinancial records\">Ignore nonfinancial records</option><option value=\"Assume fraud without further work\">Assume fraud without further work</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs2-f2\">Correct the assurance promise</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs2-f2\"><option value=\"Explain reasonable assurance about material misstatement\">Explain reasonable assurance about material misstatement</option><option value=\"Guarantee solvency\">Guarantee solvency</option><option value=\"Guarantee every transaction\">Guarantee every transaction</option><option value=\"Withdraw all audit objectives\">Withdraw all audit objectives</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs2-f3\">Identify the bias in the reserve testing</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs2-f3\"><option value=\"Confirmation bias\">Confirmation bias</option><option value=\"Sampling precision\">Sampling precision</option><option value=\"A financial statement assertion\">A financial statement assertion</option><option value=\"An independence safeguard\">An independence safeguard</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"aud-m1-tbs2-f4\">Respond to the CEO’s unrestricted entries</label><select id=\"aud-m1-tbs2-f4\"><option value=\"Perform procedures addressing management override\">Perform procedures addressing management override</option><option value=\"Eliminate substantive testing\">Eliminate substantive testing</option><option value=\"Rely only on ordinary approvals\">Rely only on ordinary approvals</option><option value=\"Accept an oral assurance\">Accept an oral assurance</option></select></div></section>",
