      "id": "aud-m1-tbs2-ex1",
      "title": "File excerpts",
      "html": "<p>1. The CFO was reliable last year, so contrary evidence was disregarded. 2. The team has promised investors that the company will never fail. 3. A senior selected only documents supporting the original reserve. 4. The CEO can override normal journal approval.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "aud-m1-tbs2-ex2",
      "title": "Required approach",
      "html": "<p>Base the audit on sufficient appropriate evidence, maintain a questioning mind, distinguish audit assurance from investment guarantees, and address management override.</p>"
